                "ImageDescription": {
                  "value": "Coldwood village, 6 km WNW of <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Craughwell\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:Craughwell\">Craughwell</a>, County Galway, Ireland. The entrance to the village has a stone monument, and a hand-painted sign saying \"Start the golden mile of Coldwood\".  The village is pretty, but I would say nothing exceptional, and I didn't find another sign saying the end of the golden mile.  It does, however, still have a separate village feel rather than the linear sprawl of houses seen elsewhere.",
